<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Eagle prices at top range, $17.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Eagle prices at top range, $17.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Eagle Geophysical Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $17</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $15 - $17</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			5,880,000</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter  Prudential Securities Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price range for the planned initial public offering in Eagle Geophysical Inc was raised to $15 to $17 per common share from $14 to $16 per common share previously.</p>
</text>
